export const zhTech = {"Adaptive motion-weighted sampling: ffmpeg decodes up to 64 probe frames (downscaled to 160×90); per-interval motion = mean abs grayscale diff between consecutive probes; the frame budget (default 12) is split across intervals weighted 0.3 + energy/peak; frames are placed evenly inside each interval, first and last always kept. The chosen frames are then tiled into one contact sheet (Pillow) and cached.": "自适应动作加权采样：ffmpeg 最多解码 64 个探测帧（缩放至 160×90）；帧间运动 = 相邻探测帧的平均绝对灰度差；帧预算（默认 12）按 0.3 + 能量/峰值 加权分配到各区间；在每个区间内均匀放置帧，始终保留首尾帧。选出的帧会被拼接成一张联系表（Pillow）并缓存。", "For every consecutive pair of sampled frames: downscale to 320×180 grayscale, take the mean absolute pixel difference (inside the subject region when available) as the energy; the global shift (dx, dy) between the two frames comes from FFT phase correlation.": "对每一对相邻采样帧：缩放为 320×180 灰度图，取平均绝对像素差（在有主体区域时限制在区域内）作为能量；两帧之间的全局位移（dx, dy）由 FFT 相位相关估计。", "Movement energy is compared against a threshold of max(median×1.3, median+0.5); contiguous spans above it become segments (≥0.4s). Each span is summarised by direction reversals along the tracked object's path (horizontal vs vertical flips).": "将动作能量与阈值 max(中位数×1.3, 中位数+0.5) 比较；连续高于阈值的时段成为片段（≥0.4 秒）。每个片段根据跟踪对象路径的方向反转（水平/垂直翻转）进行总结。", "The lower third of the subject box (the legs) is tracked frame by frame; the horizontal spread of its centre (max − min x) is the lateral range, in fractions of the frame width. Reversals in that path are counted as direction changes.": "逐帧跟踪主体框下三分之一（腿部）；其中心点的水平跨度（最大 − 最小 x）即为横向范围，以画面宽度的比例表示。路径中的反转计为方向变化。", "Absolute grayscale differences between consecutive frames are summed at 640×360, restricted to the subject region, normalised by the peak, and drawn as a red overlay on the first frame.": "将相邻帧的绝对灰度差在 640×360 下求和，限制在主体区域，按峰值归一化，并作为红色叠加层绘制在第一帧上。", "2D histogram of the subject-box centre across frames, gaussian-blurred, drawn as a red overlay on frame 1.": "对主体框中心跨帧做二维直方图，高斯模糊后作为红色叠加层绘制在第 1 帧上。", "A pose model (mediapipe PoseLandmarker, lite) finds 33 body landmarks in each sampled frame; the standard skeleton connections are drawn as lines. The single 'hero' frame is the peak-motion moment; the sheet draws every sampled frame.": "姿态模型（mediapipe PoseLandmarker lite）在每个采样帧中检测 33 个身体关键点；标准骨架连接以线条绘制。单个“hero”帧是动作峰值时刻；联系表绘制所有采样帧。", "From the 33 landmarks, joint angles are computed per frame from three points (knee = hip–knee–ankle, elbow = shoulder–elbow–wrist), plus stance width and a crouch measure. The chart plots each sampled frame; the summary reports the mean and range.": "从 33 个关键点计算每帧的关节角度（膝 = 髋–膝–踝，肘 = 肩–肘–腕），并测量站距和下蹲幅度。图表绘制每个采样帧；摘要报告平均值和范围。", "The same pose model also returns world landmarks (3D, in metres). These give 3D joint angles plus torso lean and shoulder/hip twist, and the per-frame 3D points are stored so the skeleton can be drawn in 3D and rotated (orthographic projection). Depth from one camera is approximate.": "同一姿态模型还返回世界坐标关键点（3D，单位米），给出 3D 关节角度、躯干倾斜和肩髋扭转；每帧 3D 点被保存，以便绘制可旋转的 3D 骨架（正交投影）。单摄像头深度为近似值。", "Track both pose wrists (landmarks 15/16) across frames, take the faster wrist per step, pick local maxima above a relative threshold, merge within 0.4s, and guess the dominant hand.": "跨帧跟踪两个姿态手腕（关键点 15/16），每一步取较快的手腕，在相对阈值以上选取局部极大值，合并 0.4 秒内的重复事件，并推测惯用手。", "Each tracked point gets a depth estimate z = sqrt(median_blob_area / blob_area) — a bigger blob is nearer (a monocular size cue) — combined with its screen (x, y) to plot a 3D path you can rotate. The direction of depth is meaningful; the absolute distance is not.": "每个跟踪点获得深度估计 z = sqrt(median_blob_area / blob_area)——斑点越大越近（单目尺寸线索）——结合屏幕坐标 (x, y) 绘制可旋转的 3D 路径。深度的方向有意义，绝对距离不准确。", "Start": "开始", "End": "结束", "Arrow": "箭头", "Circle": "圆形", "Pen": "画笔", "Angle": "角度", "vertical 9:16": "竖屏 9:16"};

export const zhTech2 = {"Your uploaded clip, played back here. The moments the coach pointed out are in the Key moments tab.": "你上传的视频，在此回放。教练指出的时刻位于“关键时刻”标签页。", "The handful of stills taken from your clip — the exact pictures the AI coach looked at. It favours the moments where the most happened.": "从视频中截取的少量画面——AI 教练实际查看的确切图片，优先选择动作最多的时刻。", "The clip's movement energy, moment to moment — a peak is a burst of action.": "视频逐刻的动作能量——峰值代表一次动作爆发。", "Stretches where the picture stayed consistently active, separated by calmer gaps.": "画面持续活跃的时段，之间由较平静的间隔分开。", "How far your lower body (hips and legs) travelled left–right across the clip, as a share of the frame width.": "整段视频中下半身（髋部和腿部）左右移动的距离，以画面宽度的比例表示。", "A heat map of where the picture changed most — red is where the action happened.": "画面变化最大的区域热图——红色表示动作发生的地方。", "A map of where the subject spent the most time within the frame.": "主体在画面中停留时间最长的位置图。", "Your body drawn as a stick figure, so you can see your posture at a key moment.": "你的身体以骨架图显示，便于查看关键时刻的姿态。", "Your knee and elbow angles through the clip — watch for them dipping during a shot.": "整段视频中的膝部和肘部角度——注意击球时是否下沉。", "Your body as a 3D model you can spin around. Depth is a best guess from a single camera.": "可旋转的 3D 身体模型。单摄像头深度只是近似值。", "Moments where a hand moved fastest, with which hand.": "手部移动最快的时刻，以及是哪只手。", "No small moving object detected in this clip — automatic tracking is hard here.": "此视频没有检测到小型移动物体——自动跟踪在这里较困难。", "The object's route in 3D. The shape is useful; the exact distances aren't.": "物体在 3D 中的轨迹。形状有参考价值，精确距离不准确。", "travel": "移动", "Shaded band = your side-to-side range (": "阴影带 = 你的左右移动范围（", "% of the frame width).": "占画面宽度的百分比）。", "changes of direction.": "次方向变化。", "time": "时间", "L knee": "左膝", "R knee": "右膝", "L elbow": "左肘", "R elbow": "右肘", "Torso lean": "躯干倾斜", "Shoulder twist": "肩部扭转", "Hip twist": "髋部扭转", " torso lean": "躯干倾斜", "shoulder twist": "肩部扭转", "hip twist": "髋部扭转", "tracked points": "跟踪点", "x-range": "x 范围", "y-range": "y 范围", "max speed": "最大速度"};

